1. Project Overview

This project documents hands-on practice with Microsoft Intune for Windows endpoint management and security configuration.

The objective was to explore how an IT administrator can use Microsoft Intune to apply security requirements to managed Windows devices, configure Windows Defender Firewall settings, and monitor policy deployment and device compliance.

Environment:

* Device: Windows 11 virtual machine.
* Virtualization platform: VMware Workstation 17 Player.
* Endpoint management platform: Microsoft Intune.
* Identity platform: Microsoft Entra ID.
* Management approach: Cloud-based device and policy management.

