This lab provided practical exposure to Microsoft Intune endpoint management.

I created a Windows compliance policy, configured a Windows Firewall device configuration profile, reviewed policy assignment and deployment status, and used PowerShell to inspect firewall settings.

These exercises strengthened my understanding of how IT administrators can use cloud-based endpoint management to enforce security requirements and monitor managed Windows devices.
